<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Jan 2.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Jan 2.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Iraqi press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- Jordanian ministers of industry and trade and transport to start visit to Baghdad on Monday.</p>
<p>(The above story was also carried by IRAQ and QADISSIYA)</p>
<p>- Commentary lambasting Turkey over military attack in northern Iraq.</p>
<p>BABEL</p>
<p>- Uday Saddam Hussein receives Palestinan dignitary Assa'd Bayoud al-Timimi.</p>
